<title>CHINA: China Jan-June tin exports up 44 pct yr-on-yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-June tin exports up 44 pct yr-on-yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's exports of unwrought tin and tin alloys were 18,537 tonnes in the first six months of 1997, up 44 percent from the year-ago period, customs figures available on Friday showed.</p>
<p>	  EXPORTS JAN-JUNE	 JUNE	YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Tin	18,537		 3,080	   +44</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (86) 10-6532-1921; Fax 10-6532-4978</p>
